  "details": "I want to be able to make an instance in a cross platform world where only PC players can join. I think this because most of my avatars are meant for PC and not Quest, and I don't really like using fallbacks. It is also because there are some cross platform avatars for PC and Quest but you can make the Quest avatar anything else, so they could have made the Quest avatar for example, a cube while on the PC side there is a crasher avatar. The image is a concept of my idea.",
